---

<section
  id="aluguer"
  class="bg-[var(--cor-fundo-suave)] pb-24 lg:pb-32 pt-8 px-6 lg:px-12 scroll-mt-28 sm:scroll-mt-36"
>
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div
      class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-[#181115] border border-[var(--cor-secundaria)]/35 text-white p-8 sm:p-12 lg:p-16 shadow-xl"
    >
      <div
        class="absolute -top-24 -right-24 w-96 h-96 bg-[var(--cor-destaque)]/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"
      >
      </div>

      <div class="relative z-10 max-w-3xl">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5">
          <span class="w-8 h-px bg-[var(--cor-secundaria)]"></span>
          <span
            class="text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] uppercase text-[var(--cor-secundaria)]"
          >
            Espaço Profissional &amp; Atelier
          </span>
        </div>

        <h2
          class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl text-white mb-6 leading-tight font-normal tracking-tight"
        >
          Aluguer de Cadeira e Mesa de Trabalho
        </h2>

        <p
          class="text-sm sm:text-base text-white/80 leading-relaxed font-light mb-8 max-w-2xl"
        >
          É profissional da área da beleza? Disponibilizamos para aluguer a
          nossa <strong class="text-white font-medium"
            >Cadeira de Cabeleireiro</strong
          > e <strong class="text-white font-medium"
            >Mesa de Unhas / Sala de Workshops</strong
          > (Nails e Lash Lifting). Um ambiente acolhedor, sofisticado e pronto a
          receber as suas clientes com conforto no centro de Valongo.
        </p>

        <div
          class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-2 pb-8 border-t border-white/10 max-w-xl mb-2"
        >
          <div
            class="flex items-center gap-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-white/90 font-light"
          >
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[var(--cor-secundaria)]"
            ></span>
            <span>Cadeira de Cabeleireiro Equipada</span>
          </div>
          <div
            class="flex items-center gap-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-white/90 font-light"
          >
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[var(--cor-secundaria)]"
            ></span>
            <span>Mesa de Unhas &amp; Sala de Formação</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <a
          href="https://wa.me/351919786224?text=Ol%C3%A1%2C+tenho+interesse+no+aluguer+de+mesa+ou+cadeira+na+Klassy."
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="group inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 rounded-full bg-[var(--cor-secundaria)] hover:bg-[var(--cor-secundaria-hover)] text-[#1a1217] text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider transition-all duration-300 shadow-md hover:-translate-y-0.5"
        >
          <span>Consultar Condições de Aluguer</span>
          <span
            class="text-sm transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1"
            >→</span
          >
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
